<title>JAPAN: Tietech plans share split.</title>
<headline>Tietech plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tietech Co Ltd said on Friday it planned a 1.2-for-1 share split on March 31, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
</text>
